        {
          "text": "Sasa, basi, sikia haya, wewe upendaye anasa, ukaaye na kujiona salama, wewe usemaye moyoni mwako, Mimi ndiye, wala hapana mwingine zaidi yangu mimi; sitaketi mfano wa mjane, wala sitajua kufiwa na watoto; ",
