                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndivyo yatakavyokuwa mambo hayo uliyojitaabisha nayo; wale waliofanya biashara nawe tangu ujana wako watatanga-tanga mbali nawe, kila mtu akienda zake; hapatakuwa na mtu wa kukuokoa.",
          "type": "text",
